{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215130","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721513001:1":{"text":"哟，瞧瞧是谁回来了？咱们守备军的大明星啊。这么急匆匆的，该不会是在忙圣古堂消失的大案子吧？","source_cn":"哟，瞧瞧是谁回来了？咱们守备军的大明星啊。这么急匆匆的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E3BABB9692CB5A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721513002:1":{"text":"别傻了。没听说吗？司令下了命令，严禁某些人参与此案。","source_cn":"别傻了。没听说吗？司令下了命令，严禁某些人参与此案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16A208CB61F24DE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721513003:1":{"text":"这么危险的案子，司令大人怎么舍得让他那娇贵的女儿去冒险？万一弄脏了她的铠甲怎么办？","source_cn":"这么危险的案子，司令大人怎么舍得让他那娇贵的女儿去冒险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x052A0E395E6FBA34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721513004:1":{"text":"真是遗憾。本来庆典上的军事献演可是某人的高光时刻。为了那场表演，她恐怕花了一周时间来打磨那身漂亮的铠甲吧？结果——砰！","source_cn":"真是遗憾。本来庆典上的军事献演可是某人的高光时刻。为了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF14CC7D62F15E3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721513005:1":{"text":"圣古堂没了，所有人的注意都被夺走了，这下没人记得她的英姿了。","source_cn":"圣古堂没了，所有人的注意都被夺走了，这下没人记得她的英姿了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F2FBEA7892EC96A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721513006:0":{"text":"盖伊、呼伦，住口！你们放尊重点——","source_cn":"盖伊、呼伦，住口！你们放尊重点——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6763AFC4CD572142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721513007:0":{"text":"噢——有人急了。看到了吗？这就是有个伟大家族的好处。","source_cn":"噢——有人急了。看到了吗？这就是有个伟大家族的好处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3767CE40CBF4F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721513008:0":{"text":"根本不需要自己开口，只要站在那里，就会有忠诚的卫士跳出来替主人乱叫。","source_cn":"根本不需要自己开口，只要站在那里，就会有忠诚的卫士跳出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA1B804AB42FDF93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721513009:1":{"text":"可不是嘛。如果我父亲是耀光之盾，哪怕我只会拿着木剑挥舞两下，也能混个队长当当。","source_cn":"可不是嘛。如果我父亲是耀光之盾，哪怕我只会拿着木剑挥舞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81C580862E4ABC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721513010:1":{"text":"马丁，你这么卖力地表现，之后的晋升名单上肯定有你吧？","source_cn":"马丁，你这么卖力地表现，之后的晋升名单上肯定有你吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6A8FC21B5721992","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721513011:0":{"text":"你们，岂有此理！我要向你们发起决斗，谁输了谁道歉！","source_cn":"你们，岂有此理！我要向你们发起决斗，谁输了谁道歉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA802A5AE5C0D2A6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721513012:0":{"text":"收起你的武器，马丁。","source_cn":"收起你的武器，马丁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF01A257C5C10AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721513013:0":{"text":"可是队长！这帮家伙……他们在侮辱您和司令的名誉！这绝对不能忍！","source_cn":"可是队长！这帮家伙……他们在侮辱您和司令的名誉！这绝对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8801E85329D89656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1721513014:0":{"text":"那是他们的舌头，但武器握在你手里。你的武器是为了守卫耀光而铸造的，不是为了在营地里和自己人私斗。","source_cn":"那是他们的舌头，但武器握在你手里。你的武器是为了守卫耀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B72DC7FF4AB1048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1721513015:0":{"text":"……我知道了，队长！","source_cn":"……我知道了，队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392AB9C23C347C64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1721513016:1":{"text":"跟我来。既然有人觉得我们只是靠家族名声的花瓶，那就用实力说话。今天的劈砍训练加倍。走。","source_cn":"跟我来。既然有人觉得我们只是靠家族名声的花瓶，那就用实...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B2CF7815A082ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1721513017:0":{"text":"是，队长！","source_cn":"是，队长！<key:dialog12>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F3279C7963445B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1721513018:1":{"text":"切……装什么高尚。","source_cn":"切……装什么高尚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB725747EC6E66235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守备军盖伊":{"text":"守备军盖伊","source":"守备军盖伊","status":"source"},"speaker:守备军呼伦":{"text":"守备军呼伦","source":"守备军呼伦","status":"source"},"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"守备军马丁","source":"守备军马丁","status":"source"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"格温妮丝","source":"格温妮丝","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":4}}